ine"></span> <span class="line"></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="muri-content-wrap tab-content"> <div class="line-circle-shape"> <img src="/assets/images/homeimage/line-circle.png" class="muri-line-circle" alt="this is a line circle shape"> </div> <div class="dot-rectangle-one"> <img src="/assets/images/homeimage/dot-rectangle.png" class="muri-dot-rectangle-one" alt="this is a dot rectangle shape one"> </div> <section class="muri-home-content min-vh-100 tabs__tab active" id="muri_home_content"> <div class="container"> <div class="row muri-row justify-content-center text-center"> <div class="col-12 col-lg-10 col-xxl-8"> <div class="muri-home-img"> <div class="home-img-card"> <div class="glow"></div> </div> <div class="muri-home-title"> <h1 class="muri-headi-text w-text mb-0"> 关于我 </h1> </div> <div class="home-intro-text"> <div class="muri-medi-text home-intro-text w-text">我是一名</div> <div class="text"></div> </div> <div class="home-muri-desc"> <p class="muri-short-desc mb-0">不论过去，从今以后我是一名自由职业者。我将自由地穿梭于世界的每一个角落，追求我的梦想和生活。每一天都是一张白纸，等待我用勇气和创造力书写属于自己的故事。</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <div class="dot-rectangle-two"> <img src="/assets/images/homeimage/dot-rectangle.png" class="muri-dot-rectangle-two" alt="this is a dot rectangle shape two"> </div> <div class="dline-half-circle"> <img src="/assets/images/homeimage/half-circle.png" class="muri-half-circle" alt="this is a double line half circle"> </div> </div> </div> <script src="/assets/js/jquery.min.js"></script> <script src="/assets/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script> <script src="/assets/js/preloader.js"></script> <script src="/assets/js/slick.min.js"></script> <script src="/assets/js/jquery.magnific-popup.min.js"></script> <script src="/assets/js/gsap.min.js"></script> <script src="/assets/js/prism.js"></script> <script src="/assets/js/types.min.js"></script> <script src="/assets/js/typed.js"></script> <script src="/assets/js/3danimation.js"></script> <script src=